    {
      "source": "<code>bindTarget</code> - the target to bind the value to",
      "translation": "<code>bindTarget</code> - 要绑定值的对象",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Bind markers are dialect-specific and provide a\n<a href=\"#getPlaceholder()\"><code>placeholder</code></a> that is used in the actual query.",
      "translation": "绑定标记是方言特定的，并提供一个在真实查询中使用的 <a href=\"#getPlaceholder()\"><code>placeholder</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Bind the given <code>value</code> to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Statement</code></a> using the underlying\nbinding strategy.",
      "translation": "使用底层绑定策略将给定的 <code>value</code> 绑定到 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Statement</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Bind a <code>null</code> value to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Statement</code></a> using the underlying\nbinding strategy.",
      "translation": "使用底层绑定策略将 `<code>null</code>` 值绑定到 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Statement</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the database-specific placeholder for a given substitution.",
      "translation": "返回给定替换项的数据库专用占位符。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>value</code> - the actual value (must not be <code>null</code>;\nuse <a href=\"#bindNull(org.springframework.r2dbc.core.binding.BindTarget,java.lang.Class)\"><code>bindNull(BindTarget, Class)</code></a> for <code>null</code> values)",
      "translation": "<code>value</code> - 实际值（不能为 <code>null</code>；对于 <code>null</code> 值，请使用 <a href=\"#bindNull(org.springframework.r2dbc.core.binding.BindTarget,java.lang.Class)\"><code>bindNull(BindTarget, Class)</code></a>）",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>valueType</code> - the value type (must not be <code>null</code>)",
      "translation": "<code>valueType</code> - 值类型（不能为 <code>null</code>）",
